                            <p class="cost">$95.00</p>
                        </div>
                        <button class="buy-button">Add to cart</button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="product-card">
                        <div class="product-visual">
                            <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_Body_Avail_Body_Lotion_with_Sunscreen_SPF50_US_CA_150mL_Web_Front_2000x2000px.png"
                                 class="img-base">
                            <button class="wish-icon"><i class="fa-regular fa-bookmark"></i></button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="product-details">
                            <h4>Avail Body Lotion</h4>
                            <p class="summary">SPF50, refreshing and lightweight feel.</p>
                            <p class="cost">$48.00</p>
                        </div>
                        <button class="buy-button">Add to cart</button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="product-card">
                        <div class="product-visual">
                            <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_Skin_Purifying_Facial_Exfoliant_Paste_Web_75mL_Front_A_2000x2000px.png"
                                 class="img-base">
                            <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_Skin_Purifying_Facial_Exfoliant_Paste_Web_75mL_Front_B_2000x2000px.png"
                                 class="img-reveal">
                            <button class="wish-icon"><i class="fa-regular fa-bookmark"></i></button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="product-details">
                            <h4>Purifying Facial Paste</h4>
                            <p class="summary">For dry skin and winter climates.</p>
                            <p class="cost">$59.00</p>
                        </div>
                        <button class="buy-button">Add to cart</button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="product-card">
                        <div class="product-visual">
                            <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_Skin_B_Triple_C_Facial_Balancing_Gel_Web_60mL_Front_2000x2000px.png"
                                 class="img-base">
                            <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_Skin_B_Triple_C_Facial_Balancing_Gel_60mL_Web_Texture_2000x2000px.png"
                                 class="img-reveal">
                            <button class="wish-icon"><i class="fa-regular fa-bookmark"></i></button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="product-details">
                            <h4>Lucent Facial Refiner</h4>
                            <p class="summary">A vitamin-rich hydrating serum.</p>
                            <p class="cost">$120.00</p>
                        </div>
                        <button class="buy-button">Add to cart</button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="product-card">
                        <div class="product-visual">
                            <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_Kits_Quench_Classic_Skin_Care_Kit_Web_Front_2000x2000px.png"
                                 class="img-base">
                            <button class="wish-icon"><i class="fa-regular fa-bookmark"></i></button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="product-details">
                            <h4>Ouranon Eau de Parfum</h4>
                            <p class="summary">Woody, spicy, and resinous aroma.</p>
                            <p class="cost">$210.00</p>
                        </div>
                        <button class="buy-button">Add to cart</button>
                    </div> *@
                </div>

                <button class="arrow next" id="nextBtn"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></button>
            </div>

            <div class="slider-progress">
                <div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <!-- explore -->
    <section class="feature-section">
        <div class="feature-container">

            <div class="hero-feature">
                <img src="./assets/images/module-50-50-desktop-1.jpg" alt="Background" class="hero-img">
                <div class="hero-overlay">
                    <span class="sub-title">Lucent Facial Refiner</span>
                    <h2 class="main-title">The skin-in its best light</h2>
                    <a href="#" class="explore-btn">
                        Explore Lucent Facial Refiner <span class="arrow-right">→</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="product-feature">
                <div class="product-wrapper">

                    <div class="product-header">
                        <p class="tagline">Exfoliates, hydrates, smooths</p>
                        <h3 class="intro-title">Introducing Lucent Facial Refiner</h3>
                        <p class="intro-desc">
                            A new gently exfoliating mask to even the texture and appearance of the skin,
                            with a unique combination of ingredients to refine and replenish.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="product-visual">
                        <span class="new-label">New addition</span>

                        <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_Skin_Lucent_Facial_Refiner_60mL_NGL_Front_2000x2000px (1).png"
                             alt="Product" class="img-base">
                        <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_Skin_Lucent_Facial_Refiner_60mL_NGL_Use_2000x2000px (1).png"
                             alt="Texture" class="img-reveal">

                        <button class="wish-btn"> <i class="fa-regular fa-bookmark"></i> </button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="product-details">
                        <h4 class="product-name">Lucent Facial Refiner</h4>
                        <p class="price">$97.00</p>
                        <button class="add-btn">Add to cart</button>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    <!-- formulations -->
    <section class="skin-needs-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Formulations to support the skin's needs</h2>

            <div class="needs-grid">
                <div class="need-item">
                    <a href="#" class="need-link">For 'normal' skin <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
                    <p class="need-desc">Neither oily, nor dry—better described as 'balanced'.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="need-item">
                    <a href="#" class="need-link">For dry skin <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
                    <p class="need-desc">Can be fragile, flaky, and dull in appearance due to a lack of sebum.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="need-item">
                    <a href="#" class="need-link">For oily skin <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
                    <p class="need-desc">Often shiny in appearance, with large pores due to an over-supply of sebum.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="need-item">
                    <a href="#" class="need-link">For combination skin <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
                    <p class="need-desc">Both oily and dry in nature, with a greater propensity to reactivity.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="need-item">
                    <a href="#" class="need-link">For mature skin <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
                    <p class="need-desc">Naturally depleted, with diminishing oil production and moisture retention.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="need-item">
                    <a href="#" class="need-link">For sensitive skin <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
                    <p class="need-desc">Delicate and prone to aggravation and reactivity; can affect all skin types.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <!-- understanding -->
    <section class="regimen-banner-full">
        <div class="banner-overlay-content">
            <div class="text-block">
                <span class="banner-label">Find an ideal regimen</span>
                <h2 class="banner-title">Understanding your skin</h2>
                <p class="banner-desc">
                    By identifying the characteristics of your skin, we can recommend the formulations best suited to you.
                </p>
                <a href="#" class="action-btn">
                    Begin the process <span class="arrow">→</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <!-- additional -->
    <section class="assistance-section">
        <div class="assistance-container">
            <div class="info-content">
                <h2 class="title">For additional assistance</h2>
                <p class="description">
                    If you could use some guidance finding the ideal formulation for your individual needs,
                    our consultants are available to help at a distance.
                </p>
                <a href="#" class="consult-btn">
                    Speak to a real consultant <span class="arrow">→</span>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="image-box">
                <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_Category_Page_All_Secondary_3_Assistance_Mobile_640x640px.jpg"
                     alt="Skincare Consultation" class="consultant-img">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <!-- recommended -->
    <section class="reading-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Recommended reading</h2>

            <div class="reading-grid">
                <article class="reading-card">
                    <div class="card-image">
                        <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_NGL_Athenaeum_Thumbnail_How_to_Curate_a_Skin_Care_Regimen_Mobile_1080x800px.jpg"
                             alt="Lessons from the lab">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <span class="category">Lessons from the lab</span>
                        <h3 class="card-title">How to curate a skin care regimen</h3>
                        <p class="read-time">Seven-minute read</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="reading-card">
                    <div class="card-image">
                        <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_NGL_Athenaeum_Thumbnail_On_Blending_Mobile_1080x800px.jpg"
                             alt="Interview">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <span class="category">Interview</span>
                        <h3 class="card-title">Expert recommendations: consultants on blending</h3>
                        <p class="read-time">Seven-minute read</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="reading-card">
                    <div class="card-image">
                        <img src="./assets/images/Aesop_NGL_Athenaeum_Thumbnail_The_Anatomy_and_Physiology_of_the_Skin_Mobile_1080x800px.jpg"
                             alt="Anatomy of skin">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <span class="category">Lessons from the lab</span>
                        <h3 class="card-title">The anatomy and physiology of the skin</h3>
                        <p class="read-time">Five-minute read</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main> 